Use the KSA title card as the wrapper's app icon

Sikarugir wrappers show a generic icon. This one is the bottom square of KSA's
title card (the kitten astronaut), at 1024x1024. The Dock may keep showing
the old icon until it restarts.
---
target wrapper:Resources/Configure.icns
$ curl -fsSLo card.jpg https://ahwoo.com/ksa/title-card.jpg
$ # The card is 900x1350: keep the bottom 898x898 (sips skips the crop if an offset is 0).
$ sips -s format png -c 898 898 --cropOffset 452 1 card.jpg --out square.png
$ mkdir icon.iconset
$ sips -z 1024 1024 square.png --out icon.iconset/icon_512x512@2x.png
$ iconutil -c icns icon.iconset -o "$OUT"
$ printf '%s\n' "The app icon (files/wrapper/Resources/Configure.icns) is made from the Kitten Space Agency" "title card, https://ahwoo.com/ksa/title-card.jpg. Copyright (c) RocketWerkz, all rights" "reserved. It is not covered by this mod's MIT license." > "$LICENSES/KSA-title-card.txt"
